No, the cockatrice eggs will be *stacked*, e.g. a stack of thirty
meatballs will become a stack of *thirty stoning grenades*, which is
probably more than the number of death rays you'll shoot in an average
game. You only have to taste a single egg to see if the stack contains
a stoning grenade. After that, place the eggs inside a container until
they die.


